Integrated luminosity measured by horizontal Roman Pots as a function of data set is visualized on the Figure 3.21. In the same graph luminosity calculated based on coincidence rates in BBC detector is contained. An overall uncertainty (statistical and systematic) of the BBC-derived luminosity is estimated to be 10% [23] and such error is included to the data points, whereas uncertainty of the \(\mathcal{L}\) parameter on the plot is only statistical.

